.TH sway-things-hook-wallpaper 1 "" "Sway Things 0.4.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-hook\-wallpaper \- Show the next picture of each wallpaper collection whose time has come, and start the timers of those that change daily or after an interval: run when sway starts while a display shows a collection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things hook wallpaper\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the next picture of each wallpaper collection whose time has come, and start the timers of those that change daily or after an interval: run when sway starts while a display shows a collection
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
